==Important events==
{{spoilers}}
* [[Whitney]], [[DJ Mary]], and the [[Radio Director]] visit [[Pryce]]'s Gym, where they battle a {{p|Suicune}} statue and soon leave upon realizing that it was made of mobile ice. In the aftermath, Pryce puts on an evil smirk and mutters that Suicune won't come to visit him for a good reason.
* {{Adv|Crystal}} meets up with {{adv|Gold}} and {{adv|Silver}} in the [[Whirl Islands]], who were earlier joined by [[Lt. Surge]].
* The three [[Johto]] [[Pokédex holder]]s almost succeed in capturing the {{p|Lugia}} that attacked them.
**They try to track the Pokémon down, but all three of their Pokédexes fail in doing so, indicating that someone managed to catch it first.
* Suicune joins [[Misty]]'s team in the [[Tohjo Falls]].
* The opening ceremonies of the 10th [[Pokémon League]] commences, with all 16 Gym Leaders participating in a tournament. Gold and Crystal are called upon to attend this event secretly.

